{"id":102,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"أَلْهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","transliteration":"Al haaku mut takathur","translation":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","transliteration":"Hatta zurtumul-maqaabir","translation":"Until you visit the graveyards."},{"number":3,"arabicText":"كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"Kalla sawfa ta'lamoon","translation":"No! You are going to know."},{"number":4,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"Thumma kalla sawfa ta'lamoon","translation":"Then no! You are going to know."},{"number":5,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","transliteration":"Kalla law ta'lamoona 'ilmal yaqeen","translation":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty..."},{"number":6,"arabicText":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","transliteration":"Latara-wun nal jaheem","translation":"You will surely see the Hellfire."},{"number":7,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","transliteration":"Thumma latara wunnaha 'ainal yaqeen","translation":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","transliteration":"Thumma latus alunna yauma-izin 'anin na'eem","translation":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure."}]}